<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS 128-5 V SRI LANKA (192-6 DEC) - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LEEWARD ISLANDS 128-5 V SRI LANKA (192-6 DEC) - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Leeward Islands, replying to Sri Lanka's first innings score of 192 for six declared, were 128 for five at lunch on the second day of the three-day tour match on Monday.</p>
</text>
